    ##         If the entry point's name is anything other than ufusr, the signature of the function must be following format, where ENTRY_POINT is a function name other than ufusr:<br/>
    ##         void ENTRY_POINT(std::vector\<NXVariant\> variants, NXVariant &amp; retVal)
